<title>USA: Apartment Investment sees 1997 div $1.85/shr.</title>
<headline>Apartment Investment sees 1997 div $1.85/shr.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apartment Investment and Management Co said Tuesday it intends to set the 1997 annual dividend at $1.85 per share, an 8.8 percent increase from the 1996 dividend of $1.70 per share.</p>
<p>The company said it expects the increase will be effective commencing with the February 1997 dividend payment.  The company currently pays $0.425 quarterly.</p>
<p>Generally, the company said its policy is to increase its dividend at about one half the rate of increased profitability.</p>
</text>
